        "resolved_source_sections": {
          "identity_preservation_core": "* Tsaeytte is a Youth-phase high elf, apparent age 17–18, with a petite slender build, about 5 feet tall, slim limbs, narrow waist and hips, and softly sloped shoulders.\n* Her skin is light warm golden-beige with a subtle sun-kissed tan, warm peach-gold undertones, and natural healthy color.\n* Her hair is long and thick, reaching mid-back behind the shoulders, with a lightly rumpled texture and soft layered separation.\n* A woodland-green ribbon bow is secured at the back of the head at the nape, with short trailing ends where visible.\n* Preserve her long pointed high-elf ears angled outward and slightly upward, exposing them only where the view and hair permit.\n\nMaintain the same Youth-phase identity, age, long mid-back hair, ribbon placement, ear anatomy, and petite slender proportions. Preserve naturally visible traits without turning the head or body to expose hidden features.",
          "identity_preservation_costume": "* Simple practical rural student clothing: leaf-green long-sleeved blouse with modest gathered neckline near the collarbone, simple front tie, loose sleeves gathered at the wrists, and a fully covered waist tucked or gathered into a broad brown leather belt.\n* A full plain dark forest-green wool skirt falls to lower-calf or ankle height as the pose permits. Thick cream socks and sturdy brown leather lace-up ankle boots with low practical heels remain visible below it.\n* Keep the fabric matte, durable, modest, and unadorned, with no jewelry, weapons, signs of wealth, adult adventuring gear, leggings, armor, ornate robes, or glamorous uniform.\n\nPreserve naturally visible costume traits without changing the requested body or head orientation to expose hidden features.",
